      "id": "claim_13186a3fab8340f690fd56163bc73040",
      "statement": "RhPaymentsProvider provides the shared payments context (subscription, plan, isSubscribed, canManageBilling, seatsAvailable) and methods for Stripe-based subscriptions, seat licenses, catalog, and orders. It must be placed inside RhAuthProvider (usePayments throws when called outside a RhPaymentsProvider), and it automatically loads the subscription on sign-in/team switch and clears it on sign-out/clearSession.",
