      "id": "claim_f487776fae4f42bf98978e02b36e7b08",
      "statement": "Payments features are opt-in via config.payments. When the flag is true the provider loads the team's subscription automatically; when it is absent or false, loadSubscription returns null without calling the API and no request to /stripe/* is ever made — preventing 404s on services without the stripe plugin.",
