      "id": "claim_c19abe1898284a1582668cadd26eb3cc",
      "statement": "canManageBilling is derived from the current user's team role matching config.ownershipRole (default 'owner') and gates checkout, the billing portal, and license management. The configured role must match the service's accountsConfig.ownership-role, or the billing UI is shown to the wrong people and hidden from the right ones.",
