    {
      "id": "claim_930983b52aff4c1fa9391350e5404bf7",
      "statement": "Subscription loading is keyed on the current team id (teamKey: the team's $oid, empty string for a signed-in user with no team, null when signed out) rather than on auth.user object identity. Because updateProfile and acceptConsents re-run checkSession and replace the user with a freshly parsed document, those refreshes deliberately do not reload the subscription — a subscription changes with the team, not with the profile.",
