    {
      "id": "claim_5fbc8e0dbd764171914aa81bde383aab",
      "statement": "Payments methods surface checkout and webhook-race failures to the caller without corrupting provider state: createCheckoutSession rejects with status 409 when the team already has an active subscription (send users to openBillingPortal instead; subscription state is unchanged), grantLicense rejects with status 409 when no seat is available, and waitForSubscription/waitForOrder reject with WaitTimeoutError when the Stripe webhook has not arrived — timing out is not a payment failure. loadSubscription itself swallows API errors by resetting subscription to null.",
